</style></div></div><main class="main-wrapper"><section class="section_hero-about-a"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div data-w-id="316b18a9-b274-1a47-898d-5a75efd64fbb" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="headline_hero project"><div class="master_label"><div class="icon-label"></div><div class="text-size-small">Project - Hemerdon Mine</div></div><div class="heading_hero-home"><h1>One of the world’s largest tungsten resources. <span class="text-color-teal">On our doorstep.</span></h1><p class="project_copy">The Hemerdon Mine at Drakelands, South Devon, is Tungsten West&#x27;s wholly-owned asset. It is one of the world&#x27;s largest tungsten resources, fully permitted, and ready to re-start production.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_about-video"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div data-w-id="7e1c4e72-bb6b-44ca-cf80-d89d9efd519e" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image_about-a"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92e2727153563c671b_hero.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92e2727153563c671b_hero-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92e2727153563c671b_hero-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92e2727153563c671b_hero-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92e2727153563c671b_hero.avif 1600w" alt="Aerial view of an industrial facility with two large circular tanks containing greenish liquid and a long white roofed building." class="image_about-a_image"/></div></div></div></section><section class="section_features is-project"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div class="features_headling"><div class="headline_features"><div class="master_label"><div class="icon-label"></div><div class="text-size-small">Tungsten</div></div><h2 class="margin-0 text-color-black">The story so far</h2></div><a href="/project/tungsten" button="" data-wf--cta-primary--variant="primary" class="cta_primary w-inline-block"><div class="button_text-mask"><div button-text="" class="text-button">Understand the opportunity </div></div><div class="icon-wrap_button right"><div button-icon-right="" class="icon_button w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none">
  <path d="M2.5 6H9.5M9.5 6L6 2.5M9.5 6L6 9.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="var(--_❇️-icon---icon-stroke)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div><div button-icon-right="" class="icon_button w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none">
  <path d="M2.5 6H9.5M9.5 6L6 2.5M9.5 6L6 9.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="var(--_❇️-icon---icon-stroke)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div></div><div button-bg="" class="btn-bg"></div><div class="w-embed"><style>

  
  [button]:hover .icon-wrap_button {
    color: var(--_🎨-color--tokens---button--primary--Hover--icon);
  

  [button]:where(.w-variant-1ff8d96e-78cc-eac8-de90-206ecdaded5f):hover .icon-wrap_button:where(.w-variant-1ff8d96e-78cc-eac8-de90-206ecdaded5f) {
    color: var(--_🎨-color--tokens---button--secondary--hover--icon);
  }
    
</style></div></a></div><div class="master_features"><div class="card_feature"><div class="content_feature"><div class="title_feature text-color-dark"><h3 class="heading-style-h4 heading-alternative"><span>1867: The discovery </span></h3></div><div class="feature_bottom-tile"><p class="margin-0">The ore body at Hemerdon was discovered in 1867, in the landscape between Plymouth and Dartmoor that had long been associated with mining. From the beginning, the geology made a clear case for itself.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-bbd32cc9-e686-d924-c572-11030faa6be9-e86e2866" class="image_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69f56e4ea046cac25e2c7297_rkVCsscg.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69f56e4ea046cac25e2c7297_rkVCsscg-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69f56e4ea046cac25e2c7297_rkVCsscg-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69f56e4ea046cac25e2c7297_rkVCsscg-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69f56e4ea046cac25e2c7297_rkVCsscg-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69f56e4ea046cac25e2c7297_rkVCsscg.avif 2048w" alt="Two young women lying on grass, one smiling with eyes closed, the other relaxed with eyes closed." class="image_cover"/></div></div><div class="card_feature second"><div class="content_feature"><div class="title_feature"><h3 class="heading-style-h4 heading-alternative"><span>A site with a track record</span></h3></div><div class="feature_bottom-tile"><p class="margin-0">Hemerdon has seen periods of production since the First World War, called upon at the moments Britain needed it most. The question was never whether the resource was good enough — it was whether the operation was designed well enough to do it justice.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-bbd32cc9-e686-d924-c572-11030faa6bf8-e86e2866" class="image_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b920c17b8c0049109ad_tungsten-2.avif" loading="lazy" alt="Smiling elderly man with glasses holding a smartphone in a garden with green plants in the background." class="image_cover"/></div></div><div class="card_feature third"><div class="content_feature"><div class="title_feature"><h3 class="heading-style-h4 heading-alternative"><span>2019: A new chapter </span></h3></div><div class="feature_bottom-tile"><p class="margin-0">Tungsten West acquired the mine in December 2019 with one intention: to do it successfully. A redesigned process plant, a revised feasibility study, a fully funded restoration bond, and a team with the technical depth to deliver. The permits are in place. Construction is underway. We&#x27;re finishing what the geology always promised.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-bbd32cc9-e686-d924-c572-11030faa6c07-e86e2866" class="image_feature"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92bb2bc0e1bedea319_tungsten-3.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92bb2bc0e1bedea319_tungsten-3-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/69df2b92bb2bc0e1bedea319_tungsten-3.avif 640w" alt="Smiling family of four sitting closely together on a couch watching television, with father holding a remote control." class="image_cover"/></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_how-it-works is-project"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div data-w-id="5e0439e6-b530-2479-19ab-687beac37881" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="headline_hiw"><div class="master_label"><div class="icon-label"></div><div class="text-size-small">Where it fits</div></div><h2>The Hemerdon Mine</h2></div><div class="w-layout-grid hiw_halves is-project"><div class="content_hiw-column is-project"><div class="list_hiw"><div data-w-id="5e0439e6-b530-2479-19ab-687beac3788d" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="item_hiw"><div class="icon_tick-hiw w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
