13.3184 19.9388 14.8584L18.2138 13.2816C18.0294 13.1129 17.8007 13.0004 17.5546 12.9572C17.3085 12.914 17.0551 12.942 16.8244 13.0378L13.9688 14.2247C13.7599 14.3125 13.5771 14.4525 13.4379 14.6313C13.2987 14.8101 13.2077 15.0216 13.1738 15.2456L12.9506 16.7634C12.9036 17.0831 12.9761 17.4088 13.1543 17.6783C13.3324 17.9478 13.6038 18.1421 13.9163 18.2241L15.9281 18.75C15.9603 18.759 15.9897 18.7761 16.0134 18.7997L16.4053 19.1916C14.687 20.2463 12.6474 20.6498 10.6569 20.3288C8.66647 20.0078 6.85712 18.9836 5.5575 17.4422ZM17.3344 18.5325L16.8103 18.0066C16.6455 17.8416 16.4397 17.7234 16.2141 17.6644L14.2022 17.1366C14.1575 17.1248 14.1187 17.097 14.0933 17.0584C14.0678 17.0198 14.0575 16.9732 14.0644 16.9275L14.2884 15.4097C14.2931 15.3776 14.306 15.3472 14.3259 15.3216C14.3457 15.296 14.3719 15.2759 14.4019 15.2634L17.2566 14.0766C17.2896 14.0628 17.3258 14.0588 17.361 14.0649C17.3962 14.071 17.4289 14.0871 17.4553 14.1112L19.4578 15.9431C18.9284 16.9383 18.2067 17.8185 17.3344 18.5325Z" fill="#004145"/>
</svg></div><div class="text-wrap_item-hiw"><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">A world-class deposit</h3><p>The Hemerdon ore body holds 39.7 million metric tonne units of contained tungsten across 327 million tonnes of JORC-compliant ore. By any global measure, this is a tier-one resource, and it&#x27;s in Devon.</p></div></div><div data-w-id="5e0439e6-b530-2479-19ab-687beac37894" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="item_hiw"><div class="icon_tick-hiw w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
  <path d="M12 2.4375C10.1087 2.4375 8.25991 2.99833 6.68736 4.04907C5.11482 5.09981 3.88917 6.59327 3.16541 8.34059C2.44164 10.0879 2.25227 12.0106 2.62125 13.8656C2.99022 15.7205 3.90096 17.4244 5.2383 18.7617C6.57564 20.099 8.27951 21.0098 10.1345 21.3788C11.9894 21.7477 13.9121 21.5584 15.6594 20.8346C17.4067 20.1108 18.9002 18.8852 19.9509 17.3126C21.0017 15.7401 21.5625 13.8913 21.5625 12C21.5595 9.46478 20.5511 7.03425 18.7584 5.24158C16.9658 3.44891 14.5352 2.44048 12 2.4375ZM12 20.4375C10.3312 20.4375 8.69992 19.9426 7.31238 19.0155C5.92484 18.0884 4.84338 16.7706 4.20477 15.2289C3.56616 13.6871 3.39907 11.9906 3.72463 10.3539C4.05019 8.71721 4.85379 7.21379 6.03379 6.03379C7.2138 4.85378 8.71722 4.05019 10.3539 3.72462C11.9906 3.39906 13.6871 3.56615 15.2289 4.20477C16.7706 4.84338 18.0884 5.92484 19.0155 7.31238C19.9427 8.69992 20.4375 10.3312 20.4375 12C20.435 14.237 19.5453 16.3817 17.9635 17.9635C16.3817 19.5453 14.237 20.435 12 20.4375ZM17.8125 12C17.8125 12.1492 17.7532 12.2923 17.6478 12.3977C17.5423 12.5032 17.3992 12.5625 17.25 12.5625H12C11.8508 12.5625 11.7077 12.5032 11.6023 12.3977C11.4968 12.2923 11.4375 12.1492 11.4375 12V6.75C11.4375 6.60082 11.4968 6.45774 11.6023 6.35225C11.7077 6.24676 11.8508 6.1875 12 6.1875C12.1492 6.1875 12.2923 6.24676 12.3978 6.35225C12.5032 6.45774 12.5625 6.60082 12.5625 6.75V11.4375H17.25C17.3992 11.4375 17.5423 11.4968 17.6478 11.6023C17.7532 11.7077 17.8125 11.8508 17.8125 12Z" fill="#004145"/>
</svg></div><div class="text-wrap_item-hiw"><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">A long-term asset</h3><p>The primary tungsten processing life is around 17 years of primary ore feed and subsequent stockpile re-processing, with total life extending to 40 years or more under the Hemerdon Futures programme. This is not a short-term extraction play. It is a multi-generational industrial asset with decades of production ahead of it.</p></div></div><div data-w-id="5e0439e6-b530-2479-19ab-687beac3789b" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="item_hiw"><div class="icon_tick-hiw w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
  <path d="M9.00006 18H15.0001M10.0001 21H14.0001M9.00006 15C9.00106 13 8.50106 12.5 7.50006 11.5C6.49906 10.5 6.02506 9.487 6.00006 8C5.95306 4.95 8.00006 3 12.0001 3C16.0011 3 18.0491 4.95 18.0001 8C17.9771 9.487 17.5001 10.5 16.5001 11.5C15.5011 12.5 15.0011 13 15.0001 15" stroke="#004145" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div><div class="text-wrap_item-hiw"><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">More than tungsten</h3><p>Alongside tungsten, the operation also produces tin and premium aggregates. A diversified output that adds commercial resilience and keeps more value in the local economy.</p></div></div><div data-w-id="9b8c80f8-e3b9-95bf-406a-1cc4f95df1e9" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="item_hiw"><div class="icon_tick-hiw w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
  <path d="M21.3459 4.80668C21.2785 4.75407 21.2 4.71752 21.1163 4.69981C21.0327 4.6821 20.9461 4.6837 20.8631 4.70449L15.0656 6.15387L9.25312 3.24762C9.13294 3.18767 8.99526 3.1727 8.865 3.20543L2.865 4.70543C2.7432 4.73554 2.63497 4.80551 2.55751 4.9042C2.48005 5.0029 2.43781 5.12466 2.4375 5.25012V18.7501C2.4375 18.8356 2.45699 18.92 2.49451 18.9969C2.53202 19.0738 2.58657 19.141 2.654 19.1936C2.72143 19.2463 2.79997 19.2828 2.88364 19.3005C2.96732 19.3182 3.05392 19.3166 3.13687 19.2957L8.93438 17.8464L14.7469 20.7526C14.8671 20.8126 15.0047 20.8275 15.135 20.7948L21.135 19.2948C21.2568 19.2647 21.365 19.1947 21.4425 19.096C21.52 18.9973 21.5622 18.8756 21.5625 18.7501V5.25012C21.5625 5.1646 21.543 5.08022 21.5054 5.00338C21.4679 4.92654 21.4134 4.85927 21.3459 4.80668ZM9.5625 4.66043L14.4375 7.09793V19.3398L9.5625 16.9023V4.66043ZM3.5625 5.69168L8.4375 4.47293V16.8114L3.5625 18.0301V5.69168ZM20.4375 18.3114L15.5625 19.5301V7.18887L20.4375 5.97012V18.3114Z" fill="#004145"/>
</svg></div><div class="text-wrap_item-hiw"><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">The right location</h3><p>Hemerdon sits between Plymouth and Dartmoor, within one of the UK&#x27;s most connected regional economies. Road infrastructure, a skilled regional workforce, and proximity to Plymouth&#x27;s port and logistics network make this not just a great deposit, but a practical one to operate.</p></div></div><div data-w-id="81e28d50-94a5-e1b6-fe69-ddee029bb40e" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="item_hiw"><div class="icon_tick-hiw w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
  <path d="M16 7H22M22 7V13M22 7L13.5 15.5L8.5 10.5L2 17" stroke="#004145" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
</svg></div><div class="text-wrap_item-hiw"><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">A head start no new mine can buy</h3><p>Over US$300m has already been previously invested in the site by the former operator, including crushing circuits, site offices, power supply, and access roads. For a project of this scale, that is an extraordinary starting position. The capital has been spent. The groundwork is laid. We&#x27;re here to make it work.</p></div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_5e0439e6-b530-2479-19ab-687beac378a5-e86e2866" data-w-id="5e0439e6-b530-2479-19ab-687beac378a5" style="-webkit-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-moz-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);-ms-transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);transform:translate3d(0, 50px, 0) scale3d(1, 1, 1) rotateX(0) rotateY(0) rotateZ(0) skew(0, 0);opacity:0" class="image_hiw-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a1f81131746e0d5fc75a8a7_where-it-fits.avif" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a1f81131746e0d5fc75a8a7_where-it-fits-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a1f81131746e0d5fc75a8a7_where-it-fits-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a1f81131746e0d5fc75a8a7_where-it-fits-p-1080.avif 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a1f81131746e0d5fc75a8a7_where-it-fits-p-1600.avif 1600w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69d6c3ce43485ab7fac9a1df/6a1f81131746e0d5fc75a8a7_where-it-fits.avif 2500w" alt="" class="image_hiw"/></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842e6f" class="section_timeline"><div class="padding-global"><div class="container-large"><div class="timeline_component"><div data-w-id="e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842e74" class="timeline_headline"><div class="master_label"><div class="icon-label"></div><div class="text-size-small">The Timeline</div></div><h2>Where we are now</h2></div><div class="spacer-xxlarge"></div><div data-w-id="e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842e7a" class="timeline_content"><div class="timeline_progress"><div class="timeline_fade-overlay-top"></div><div class="timeline_progress-line"></div><div class="timeline_line"></div><div class="timeline_fade-overlay-bottom"></div><div class="timeline_progress-line-cover"></div></div><div id="w-node-e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842e81-63842e6f" class="timeline_list"><div class="timeline_row"><div class="timeline_item"><div>Q4 2025</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">Refinery trial production successfully completed</h3></div><div id="w-node-e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842e89-63842e6f" class="timeline_circle-wrapper"><div class="timeline_circle"></div></div><div class="timeline_empty-space"></div></div><div class="timeline_row"><div class="timeline_empty-space"></div><div class="timeline_circle-wrapper"><div class="timeline_circle"></div></div><div class="timeline_item"><div>Q1 2026</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">Equity raise of £44.3 million</h3></div></div><div class="timeline_row"><div class="timeline_item"><div>Q2 2026</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">$25m short term bridge loan facility to fund us through to initial production</h3></div><div id="w-node-_69707ec6-d53b-20bd-2aab-382f11921c4c-63842e6f" class="timeline_circle-wrapper"><div class="timeline_circle"></div></div><div class="timeline_empty-space"></div></div><div class="timeline_row"><div class="timeline_empty-space"></div><div class="timeline_circle-wrapper"><div class="timeline_circle"></div></div><div class="timeline_item"><div>2026</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">Capital improvement works underway; fine gravity circuit targeted Q3, coarse circuit Q4</h3></div></div><div class="timeline_row"><div class="timeline_item"><div>Q1 2027</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">Full commissioning of nameplate capacity commences</h3></div><div id="w-node-e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842e9d-63842e6f" class="timeline_circle-wrapper"><div class="timeline_circle"></div></div><div class="timeline_empty-space"></div></div><div class="timeline_row"><div class="timeline_empty-space"></div><div class="timeline_circle-wrapper"><div class="timeline_circle"></div></div><div class="timeline_item"><div>H2 2027</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">Steady State production achieved</h3></div></div><div id="w-node-e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842eaa-63842e6f" class="timeline_row"><div class="timeline_item"><div>2027</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><h3 class="heading-style-h6 heading-alternative text-color-green">Full steady-state production ramp-up completed</h3></div><div id="w-node-e08f5ed8-582d-17a8-3329-124663842eb1-63842e6f" class="timeline_circle-wrapper"><div class="timeline_circle"></div></div><div class="timeline_empty-space"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-w-id="5fdfac8d-bea9-e81f-9526-a77efcf28d57" class="section_cta"><div class="padding-global"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer container-large w-container"><div class="cta_component"><div class="content_cta"><h2 data-w-id="5fdfac8d-bea9-e81f-9526-a77efcf28d5c">Want to know more?</h2><p data-w-id="ec22c18d-fabb-c744-353a-023c83a4d47e">Whether you&#x27;re looking to invest in a world-class mineral asset or build a career in the heart of Devon, there&#x27;s a place for y